      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `translate_text.py` file that translates a single text string between languages using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is a neural machine translation service. The code will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3), which is specific to Amazon Web Services. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the Amazon Translate client. </thinking>\n",
